"UFC Vegas 109 fight card, start time, date and location | Dolidze vs. Hernandez","Event: UFC Vegas 109: “Dolidze vs. Hernandez” Date: Sat., Aug. 9, 2025 Location: UFC APEX in Las Vegas, Nevada Broadcast: ESPN/ESPN+ Start Time: 4 p.m. ET Prelims Card | 7 p.m. ET Main Card UFC Vegas 109 fight card, start time, date and location | Dolidze vs. Hernandez It’s a battle of Top 10 middleweight contenders when Roman Dolidze collides with Anthony Hernandez atop the UFC Vegas 109 fight card this weekend at APEX, with the winner moving to the top of a very short list of eligible 185-pound title contenders! UFC Vegas 109 Main Event On ESPN/ESPN+: 185 lbs.: Roman Dolidze vs. Anthony Hernandez UFC Vegas 109 Main Card on ESPN/ESPN+ (7 p.m. ET): 125 lbs.: Steve Erceg vs. Ode Osbourne 115 lbs.: Angela Hill vs. Iasmin Lucindo 145 lbs.: Andre Fili vs. Christian Rodriguez 145 lbs.: Miles Johns vs. Jean Matsumoto 185 lbs.: Eryk Anders vs. Christian Leroy Duncan UFC Vegas 109 Prelims Card on ESPN/ESPN+ (4 p.m. ET): 205 lbs.: Julius Walker vs. Raffael Cerqueira 135 lbs.: Elijah Smith vs. Toshiomi Kazama 135 lbs.: Priscila Cachoeira vs. Joselyne Edwards 170 lbs.: Uros Medic vs. Gilbert Urbina 125 lbs.: Gabriella Fernandes vs. Julija Stoliarenko 205 lbs.: Cody Brundage vs. Eric McConico *Fight card, bout order and amount of fights remain subject to change.* MIDDLEWEIGHT MAYHEM! Ultimate Fighting Championship (UFC) returns to its APEX facility in Las Vegas, Nevada, on Sat., Aug. 9, 2025, with UFC Vegas 109. That’s where No. 8-ranked Middleweight contender, Roman Dolidze, clashes with No. 10-seeded Anthony Hernandez in a high-stakes main event showdown scheduled for five, five-minute rounds. In UFC Vegas 109’s co-main event, former Flyweight title challenger, Steve Erceg, takes on Ode Osbourne, with both fighters looking to climb the 125-pound rankings. MMAmania.com will deliver LIVE round-by-round, blow-by-blow coverage of the entire UFC Vegas 109 fight card RIGHT HERE, starting with the ESPN+ “Prelims” undercard bouts at 4 p.m. ET, followed by the remaining main card balance on ESPN/ESPN+ at 7 p.m. ET. To checkout the latest and greatest UFC Vegas 109 news and notes be sure to hit up our comprehensive event archive here.",2025-07-04,https://www.mmamania.com/2025/7/4/24461707/ufc-vegas-109-fight-card-start-time-date-location-dolidze-vs-hernandez-apex-espn-mma
Roman Dolidze vs Anthony Hernandez Preview & Picks – Fluffy To Earn Points Win At UFC APEX,"How to Watch UFC Fight Night: Dolidze vs Hernandez Live Stream 29 Jul 2025 Read More Roman Dolidze vs Anthony Hernandez Preview & Picks – Fluffy To Earn Points Win At UFC APEX - Roman Dolidze vs Anthony Hernandez picks for Saturday, August 9 - UFC Fight Night is taking place at the UFC APEX in Las Vegas, Nevada - Preview, predictions, stats & form - Roman Dolidze vs Anthony Hernandez Preview & Picks - Roman Dolidze Form - Anthony Hernandez Form Roman Dolidze vs Anthony Hernandez Preview & Picks Roman Dolidze vs Anthony Hernandez Preview & Picks Anthony Hernandez is tipped to score a decision victory over Roman Dolidze. Hernandez is a cardio machine with great wrestling, so we expect him to grapple, smother and frustrate Dolidze for five rounds. - Anthony Hernandez is on a 7-fight win streak - All 3 of Roman Dolidze’s career defeats have been by decision - 4 of Roman Dolidze’s last 5 fights have gone the distance Roman Dolidze Form Roman Dolidze is the number eight ranked middleweight contender with a professional record of 15-3 (8 KOs, 3 Subs). Dolidze made his UFC debut in 2020 and made a successful start in the light-heavyweight division, knocking out Khadis Ibragimov and out-pointing John Allan. He moved down to middleweight after that and endured a rough debut as he dropped a decision to Trevin Giles. The 37-year-old Georgian recovered quickly with a points win over Laureano Staropoli, and backed that up by knocking out Kyle Daukaus, Phil Hawes and Jack Hermansson in 2022. Dolidze’s rise was halted by a points loss to Marvin Vettori, and he then dropped a decision to Nassourdine Imavov. He has not lost since though, sparking a three-fight win streak with a decision victory over Anthony Smith. Dolidze then ended 2024 with a first-round knockout of Kevin Holland, before beginning his 2025 campaign with a points win over Marvin Vettori. Anthony Hernandez Form Anthony Hernandez is the number nine ranked middleweight contender with a career record of 14-2 (3 KOs, 8 Subs) with 1 No Contest. Hernandez joined the UFC in 2019 but got off to a rough start as he lost two of his first three fights. He rallied though, and kick-started a seven-fight win streak with a second-round submission win over Rodolfo Vieira. The 31-year-old Californian then backed that up with a decision win over Josh Fremd, before submitting Marc-Andre Barriault in the third round. Hernandez kept the stoppage wins coming in his sole outing of 2023, knocking out Edmen Shahbazyan in the third round, and he stayed on a roll in 2024 too. ‘Fluffy’ began the year with a second-round stoppage win over Roman Kopylov, before knocking out Michel Pereira in the fifth and final round. He then opened 2025 with a unanimous decision win over Brendan Allen back in February. Verdict Anthony Hernandez has found the blueprint to success – cardio wrestling. He has done a great job of wearing out his opponents over the past few years, but Dolidze is a hard man to stop so the judges may be required. He has done a great job of wearing out his opponents over the past few years, but Dolidze is a hard man to stop so the judges may be required. 55 Stake Cash no deposit & 550,000 Gold Coins & 5% Rakeback Use promo code NEWBONUS Sign up with the code NEWBONUS. When you verify your account get 25 Stake Cash for free PLUS 250,000 Gold Coins and 5% Rakeback! No deposit required. Login each day for the next 30 days and get an additional 30 Stake Cash AND 300,000 Gold Coins. 21+ only. T&Cs apply. Excludes WA, NY, NV, ID, KY, MI, VT, NJ, DE, WV, PA, RI & MD. 55 Stake Cash no deposit & 550,000 Gold Coins & 5% Rakeback Use promo code NEWBONUS Sign up with the code NEWBONUS. When you verify your account get 25 Stake Cash for free PLUS 250,000 Gold Coins and 5% Rakeback! No deposit required. Login each day for the next 30 days and get an additional 30 Stake Cash AND 300,000 Gold Coins. 21+ only. T&Cs apply. Ex